	(descr "Samtec TSW-104-08-F-D-RA, 2x4 2.54 mm right angle. usb_relay copy (F3.1): pad 1.45 mm (hole 1.02: ring 0.215; gap 1.09 mm between pads of different input channels, D-12 >= 1.0); pin numbering per Samtec FIG 5 (D-48): odd pins = front row (x=2.54, lower post, nearer the mating end/edge), even = rear row (x=0, upper post); pin numbers MIRRORED along the row by D-77 (pad 1 at (2.54,7.62), 1<->7 2<->8 3<->5 4<->6; positions unchanged); posts extend +x. 3D = stock pin-header STAND-IN (not the Samtec body)")
